<title>UK: Banque Worms sets $70 million 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Banque Worms sets $70 million 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE WORMS</p>
<p> AMT    $70 MLN	 BASE	*3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **29.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+70 BP    PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.85     ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STANDARD</p>
<p>NOTES  *FOR YEARS ONE TO FIVE THEN STEPS-UP TO 3M LIBOR +145 BP</p>
<p>	 **CALLABLE ON JUNE 2000, AND THEN FROM JUNE 2002</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
